<BaseLayout title="Jízda terms of use — VCode" description="Core terms for using Jízda safely." lang="en" path="/en/jizda/terms/">
  <article class="guide legal"><a class="back-link" href="/en/apps/jizda/">← Jízda</a><header><p class="kicker">Terms of use</p><h1>Jízda assists. The driver decides.</h1><p>Effective 22 September 2026.</p></header><div class="guide-body">
    <h2>Purpose</h2><p>Jízda helps record journeys, vehicles, passengers and costs and may provide navigation and road context. It does not replace driver attention, road signs, authorised instructions or professional assessment of a vehicle.</p>
    <h2>Safe use</h2><p>Do not operate the phone or app while driving. Set the destination, vehicle and passengers before leaving or after stopping safely. The driver remains responsible for safe operation and legal compliance.</p>
    <h2>Accuracy</h2><p>Location, routes, traffic information, AI suggestions and cost calculations can be incomplete or inaccurate. Verify material information with an appropriate authoritative source before relying on it.</p>
    <h2>Accounts and external services</h2><p>Some features depend on Apple services, internet access or a separate COP account. Availability may vary by device, region, permission and provider operation.</p>
    <h2>User data</h2><p>The user is responsible for the accuracy of entered records and for having a lawful basis to record information about other people. See the <a href="/en/jizda/privacy/">privacy information</a> for storage and transfers.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>Contact support at <a href="mailto:podpora@zeleznalady.cz">podpora@zeleznalady.cz</a>.</p>
  </div></article>
</BaseLayout>
